ttps://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/763">PR763</a></li><li>Update copyright years <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/764">PR764</a></li><li>Code Cleanup <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/767">PR767</a> <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/768">PR768</a> <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/772">PR772</a> <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/774">PR774</a></li><li>Add missing Location info to WhereClauseItems <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/769">PR769</a> <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/778">PR778</a></li><li>Refactor boolean polarity into enum <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/770">PR770</a></li><li>Higher Ranked Trait bounds <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/771">PR771</a></li><li>Support const evaluation within blocks <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/775">PR775</a></li><li>Mark rust_assert with no side effects <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/780">PR780</a></li><li>Fix lifetime parser bug <a href="https://github.com/Rust-GCC/gccrs/pull/771">PR771</a></li></ul>



